CVE-2026-41842: Denial of Service via versioned static resources

Reject empty/invalid paths after VersionResourceResolver strips a version
candidate, and remove the version suffix only once (lastIndexOf) so crafted
paths cannot force costly filesystem resolution. Backports the
ResourceHandlerUtils.shouldIgnoreInputPath guard for Spring Framework 6.1.x
where that helper does not yet exist.

Origin: upstream fix in Spring Framework 6.2.19 / 7.0.8 (GHSA-x23c-287f-qqv5)
Bug: CVE-2026-41842

